Based in Lynnwood Ridge, Pretoria, the group positions its core business around further expanding that portfolio through direct acquisition and greenfield development, while aiming to create environments that uplift the communities around its properties rather than simply maximising returns. Moolman Group''s scale and multi-decade history across the retail, commercial and industrial sectors make it a long-term landlord and development partner for tenants and investors operating across several of South Africa''s provinces.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://moolmangroup.co.za/about/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'moolman-group-midfields-estate' AND description = 'Moolman Group, based in Lynnwood Ridge, Pretoria, is a property investment, development and management company founded in 1967 in Polokwane, managing more than 750,000 square metres of retail, commercial and industrial space -- including regional shopping centres, CBD buildings and warehouses -- with developments in seven of South Africa''s nine provinces.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- msf-trailer-manufacturers-jan-niemand-park (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'MSF Trailer Manufacturers builds custom trailers from its Jan Niemand Park workshop, with confirmed work including mobile kitchen and fast-food trailers built to order. As a trailer manufacturer rather than a reseller, the business fabricates each unit around the customer''s specific use rather than offering a fixed, off-the-shelf range.

That approach suits customers and businesses planning a mobile food operation, from a single fast-food trailer to a fuller mobile kitchen setup, who need the trailer built around their equipment and layout rather than adapted to fit someone else''s design. Based on Brander Street in Jan Niemand Park, Pretoria, the workshop trades on weekdays with Saturday morning hours, giving customers a chance to discuss a build in person outside the standard working week.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.msftrailers.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'msf-trailer-manufacturers-jan-niemand-park' AND description = 'MSF Trailer Manufacturers, trading as MSF Trailers and Steel Works, builds a wide range of trailers in Jan Niemand Park including mobile kitchen, food, livestock, flatbed, luggage and water cart trailers, mobile freezers and mobile toilets, and cold rooms, all built with SABS-approved grade-A steel, and also offers trailer refurbishment and upgrades.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
