Aerosud holds a 15-year strategic partnership with Boeing as sole supplier of certain interior composites and thermoplastic frames, and has also designed and manufactured interior elements for the Airbus A400M Atlas military transport aircraft. That combination of long-term original equipment manufacturer relationships and in-house composite and thermoplastic manufacturing capability makes Aerosud one of South Africa''s more specialised aerospace suppliers, serving major international aircraft programmes rather than the general aviation market.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.aerosud.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'aerosud-pierre-van-ryneveld-park' AND description = 'Aerosud is a South African aerospace engineering and manufacturing company founded in 1990 and headquartered in Centurion, producing metallic, thermoplastic and composite aircraft components; the company holds a 15-year strategic partnership with Boeing as sole supplier of interior composites and thermoplastic frames, and designed and manufactured interior elements for the Airbus A400M Atlas.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
