The company positions its trailers around reliability, performance and payload capacity, engineering each range to reduce downtime and maximise the amount a fleet can carry per trip. As a family-run business built on decades of local manufacturing experience, Afrit Trailers suits transport operators and fleet buyers who want a trailer engineered and supported locally rather than imported, with the scale of a major manufacturer behind every unit.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.afrit.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'afrit-trailers-akasia' AND description = 'Afrit Trailers is Africa''s largest trailer manufacturer, a family-run business based in Rosslyn with more than 60 years in the road transport industry, producing over 6,000 trailers a year -- including side-tippers, end tippers, side curtain trailers, oil and gas tankers and car carriers -- from a 78,000 square metre plant.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
